      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "**MEMORANDUM**\n\nTo: Company Leadership  \nFrom: [Your Name], [Your Position]  \nDate: [Current Date]  \nSubject: Formal Policy on Political Expression in the Workplace  \n\nIt has been deemed necessary for our organization to establish a comprehensive policy addressing Political Expression within our professional environment. Given our commitment to fostering an inclusive, cohesive workplace, the policy will outline the acceptable forms of political expression, recognize employees' rights to individual expression, and ensure adherence to legal and ethical guidelines. This will ensure our large-scale tech firm maintains a balanced environment where every member feels valued and respected. The drafting of this policy is imperative to avoid potential misunderstandings and uphold our consistent values of professional conduct and respect.\n\nSincerely,  \n[Your Name]",
